    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub section (1) of Section (7) ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land / servitudewhich is required for the construction of Distribution, officer'sofficial residence.",
