      411.68,
      547.56,
      517.76
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorizedin writing, before me at Rattota Divisional Secretariat on 21stNovember, 2018 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested tonotify to me in writting (in duplicate) on or before 13thNovember, 2018 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
